{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XsaiPw1rvT1794349651.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普表示與伊朗的戰事可能很快結束，加上有報道指伊朗在霍爾木茲海峽問題上態度軟化，原油期貨價格下跌。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報86.04美元一桶，跌81美仙，跌幅百分之0.9。倫敦期油一度跌穿90美元一桶，是8月以來首次，收市報91.49美元一桶，跌1.08美元，跌幅百分之1.1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:08:49.113492+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:27:50.385375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:02:03.386732+00:00","content_hash":"588c17d52947d5d5ce43be731281cd7628bd69f2abd0738292fdc1b1e3d1553b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:08:49.113492+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}